# The files of 18.6.6's v17 population that AIA imports (population-operations P6).
#
#   <sha256> <bytes> <origin> <path>
#
# origin "bucket": the unit's licence-bound data bundle in the EU ops bucket, at
#   s3://$AIA_OPS_BUCKET/$AIA_LEGACY_DATA_PREFIX/<path> (data-manifest.json lists it).
# origin "unit": a configuration file of the frozen unit, in Git at
#   legacy/npc-panel-18.6.6/app/<path>, shipped beside this file in the deploy bundle.
#
# Every file lands under its base name in one flat directory, which is what
# `population_ops import` names with --panel, --dictionary and --companion.
# bin/sync-population.sh refuses a file whose hash or size differs; the import then
# judges every byte again against the Czech contract (aia_core.domain.population.czech),
# and apps/executors/tests/test_population_carry_over.py keeps this list equal to it.
